      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Coast Guard Invests in Next-Gen Heavy Weather Boats 🌊\n\n@USCG awarded a $70.9M contract for up to six second-generation Special Purpose Craft – Heavy Weather (SPC-HWX II) boats.\n\nThe world’s best boat operators are at their best with state-of-the-art capabilities. These 64-foot vessels, built to replace the storied 1950s-era fleet, will handle extreme conditions—35-foot seas, 25-foot surf, and 60-knot winds—ensuring Coast Guard boat crews can successfully respond to crises in the toughest environments.\n\nRead more here: https://t.co/7wf00w4B21\n\n@DHSgov #USCG #Innovation #ForceDesign2028",
